                "text": "External Control Messages\n\npulse_depth [0.0 \u2013 1.5]\npulse_period [30 \u2013 600]\nsim_rate [0.05 \u2013 1.0]\npulse_mix [0.0 \u2013 1.0]\npulse_gain [0.0 \u2013 2.0]\ngrain_scale [0.5 \u2013 2.0]\nout_mode [0 \u2013 3]\npulse_space [0 / 1]\nout_view [0 / 1]\nfreeze_on [0 / 1]\nreset\nbypass [0 / 1]",
