                "text": "Settings groups (Depth / Period / Grain)\n\nA source        0.6 / 147 / 1.0\nB fine rolls    0.9 / 147 / 0.6\nC big cells     0.6 / 294 / 1.6\nD slow breath   0.4 / 450 / 1.0\nE moire         0.8 / 147 / 2.0\n\nAfter changing Grain, press Reset: a formed\nfield reshapes only slowly.",
