                "text": "References\n\nWilson & Cowan (1972). Excitatory and inhibitory\ninteractions in localized populations of model neurons.\nBiophys. J. 12:1-24.\n\nErmentrout & Cowan (1979). A mathematical theory of\nvisual hallucination patterns. Biol. Cybern. 34:137-150.\n\nA port of Michael Rule's webgpgpu Example-10\nWilson-Cowan page (fixed 1024^2 solver, bare log map).\nFull notes: docs/f-reference/f_wc.md",
